{
  "id": "c1-e47-learning-from-failure",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Learning from failure",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you react when things do not go as planned?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, can you tell us about something you learnt from a mistake?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how important is it to keep trying?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4000
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think people today are afraid of failing?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e47-a1",
            "c1-e47-a2",
            "c1-e47-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people dealing with failure. Choose two of the pictures and say how these people might be feeling, and what they could learn from the experience.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these situations would you find the hardest to deal with?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e47-b1",
            "c1-e47-b2",
            "c1-e47-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people preparing or recovering. Choose two of the pictures and say what has helped these people to keep going, and what might hold them back.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, who helps you the most when you face a setback?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that help people recover from setbacks, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e47-learning-from-failure",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these things help someone to recover from failure?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e47-learning-from-failure",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the most helpful?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about resilience and failure.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is failure a necessary part of success?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent should schools reward effort rather than results?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think society is too hard on people who fail?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "How might social media make failure feel more public and more painful?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, can resilience be taught?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3200
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should companies be more open about their failures?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e47-learning-from-failure/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4600
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
